WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.620
This is one request through

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:04.080
connected tools, not independent logs.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.860
The installed official skill works with the

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.580
local payment skill and official Chain MCP
data

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.140
to decide whether a review is allowed.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.260
The recorded run reads one network snapshot.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.400
The installed skill then checks the balance

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.840
at exactly the same address and block.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.220
Both balance results must agree.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.620
Both the policy and

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.100
the balance comparison must pass.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.960
Missing data or disagreement stops the
output.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.920
The tool trace shows the real

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.540
inputs and results behind the decision.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.400
Inspect the unsigned candidate and download

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.260
the original proof to replay the checks.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.480
The run date remains visible:

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.160
historical evidence is not a current payment
authorization.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.460
Nothing is signed or broadcast.
